  "head_commit": {
    "id": "e2a1cef4b7370750c1abcbf30c89d0235cfeca9c",
    "tree_id": "7fbd2c609eadb9e336125ebdb5e4479888cc24a4",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:728] build(delivery): private IPA 728 = the delivered 727 with the Switch 2 and XeniOS sessions' fixes\n\nFrozen on 0c9237f6 (effective digest 5c1f91f9, 7904 product files). Base: the\ndelivered and verified 727 (run 43151344182).\n\n- XeniOS: XeniaCore ABI 4, pin c00755f6.\n  - The Xbox 360 JIT code region below 8 GB is held from RewindBox's launch,\n    so the first Xbox 360 launch no longer closes the app.\n  - A fatal reason is recorded.\n  - The folder import uses security-scoped access.\n- Switch 2: the S2Arm engine pin 02feeda2 is kept.\n  - The Consoles switch works (the bridge booleans).\n  - The Files import uses security-scoped access.\n  - Save import and the saves folder are always in the menu.\n  - Centred main-menu logo, Switch-style game boxes, and the fallback tile\n    takes the active pack's tile margin.\n- Kept unchanged from 727: RPCS3 Core 934 and MeloNX Core 737. MeloNX's\n  Core 739/741 come in a later IPA, as the maintainer asked.\n- Retained: Dolphin, with verify_ipa.py inherited from 727 through\n  inheritedChangedInputs; ARMSX2, libretro, MeloNX dependencies.\n\nNothing of this build has been run on an iPhone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:32:27Z",
